84400","kind":"announcement","title":"Towers of Babble Demo Updates to Address Next Fest Feedback","summary":"Hey! We've been looking closely at the feedback in our reviews and our Discord and have done a couple updates to the demo to address some common or major issues. Some significant changes: -> Added some extra UI features to explain mechanics more thoroughly -> Added the ability to hover over specials and other tooltip elements to get more information that mechanic -> Added a Gameplay Details section to explain enemy behavior/etc more thoroughly -> Added extra juice to some boss glyphs and changed","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:55:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030643","verified_at":"2026-10-22T01:15:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4984400-1846651706688768","game_id":"steam-4984400","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Clear Stats So Far & Next Fest","summary":"Hello friends! Thank you guys so much for the support in the first 10 days of the demo! We've been making a lot of updates and your feedback has been invaluable. Brief promotion: we have Next Fest coming up tomorrow, Monday Oct 19th. If you have been enjoying the demo, we would be endlessly appreciative if you told a friend to play it, as all traffic during Next Fest is invaluable in determining some sort of algorithmic mumbo jumbo. Especially if your friend is a lovely bald man who gets 12 thou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:06:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688768","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4984400-1846018067928806","game_id":"steam-4984400","kind":"announcement","title":"Towers of Babble Dem